{title: 512 - Just When I Need Him Most}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #512 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Db}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 512}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Db]Just when I need Him, [Ab7]Jesus is [Db]near,
[Gb]Just when I falter, [Db]just when I [Ab]fear;
[Ab7]Ready to help me, [Db]ready [Gb]to [Db]cheer,
[Gb]Just when I [Db]need [Ab7]Him [Db]most.
[Gb]Just when I need Him most,
[Db]Just when I need Him most,
[Eb]Jesus is [Eb7]near to [Ab]comfort and [Ab7]cheer,
[Gb]Just when I [Db]need [Ab7]Him [Db]most.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Db]Just when [Ab7]I need Him, [Db]Jesus is true,
[Gb]Never forsaking, [Db]all the [Ab]way through,
[Ab7]Giving [Db]for [Gb]burdens [Db]pleasures anew,
[Gb]Just [Db]when I [Ab7]need [Db]Him most.
[Gb]Just when I need Him most,
[Db]Just when I need Him most,
[Eb]Jesus [Eb7]is near [Ab]to comfort [Ab7]and cheer,
[Gb]Just [Db]when I [Ab7]need [Db]Him most.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Db]Just when [Ab7]I need Him, [Db]Jesus is strong,
[Gb]Bearing my [Db]burdens all [Ab]the day long;
[Ab7]For [Db]all my [Gb]sorrow giving [Db]a song,
[Gb]Just [Db]when I [Ab7]need [Db]Him most.
[Gb]Just when I need Him most,
[Db]Just when I need Him most,
[Eb]Jesus [Eb7]is near [Ab]to comfort [Ab7]and cheer,
[Gb]Just [Db]when I [Ab7]need [Db]Him most.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Db]Just when I [Ab7]need Him, He [Db]is my all,
[Gb]Answering when [Db]upon Him [Ab]I call;
[Ab7]Tenderly [Db]watching lest [Gb]I [Db]should fall,
[Gb]Just [Db]when I [Ab7]need [Db]Him most.
[Gb]Just when I need Him most,
[Db]Just when I need Him most,
[Eb]Jesus [Eb7]is near [Ab]to comfort [Ab7]and cheer,
[Gb]Just [Db]when I [Ab7]need [Db]Him most.
{end_of_verse}
